menu "Avela network"

    config AVELA_SETUP_NETWORK_NAME
        string "Setup network name"
        default "Avela-setup"
        help
            Name of the radio's own Wi-Fi setup network, opened when requested from the Wi-Fi setup screen. It
            does not open automatically when the home network is unavailable. Joining it gives access to the setup page.

    config AVELA_SETUP_NETWORK_PASSWORD
        string "Setup network password"
        default "avela_657"
        help
            WPA2 password of the setup network, 8 to 63 characters. Shown on the radio's setup screen and in its
            QR code.

    config AVELA_HOST_NAME
        string "Host name"
        default "avela"
        help
            The radio's name on the home network: DHCP host name and mDNS (http://<name>.local). The default: the
            setup page and the console can save another (Wi-Fi), in force from the next start.

endmenu
